data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"348361ab4be85a8d\" href=\"?note=348361ab4be85a8d\" title=\"57-df-compactness-property\">57-df-compactness-property</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为一阶字母表。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FO}(Q_{\\aleph_1})\">\\(\\mathrm{FO}(Q_{\\aleph_1})\\)</span> 是下式有限语法及语义给出的扩展，不是结构。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_{\\aleph_1}\">\\(Q_{\\aleph_1}\\)</span> 是新绑定构造子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists,Q_{\\aleph_1}\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists,Q_{\\aleph_1}\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>；赋值修改取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"549899f7f232c7be\" href=\"?note=549899f7f232c7be\" title=\"57-df-modified-assignment\">57-df-modified-assignment</a>。原一阶公式满足按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a> 嵌入；递归按有限公式树进行。逻辑表示的格式取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"348361ab4be85a8d\" href=\"?note=348361ab4be85a8d\" title=\"57-df-compactness-property\">57-df-compactness-property</a>。</p>\n<p>对含新量词的公式，无下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models Q_{\\aleph_1}x\\varphi\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\models Q_{\\aleph_1}x\\varphi\\)</span> 在此仅缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models_Q Q_{\\aleph_1}x\\varphi\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\models_Q Q_{\\aleph_1}x\\varphi\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^Q\">\\(\\alpha,\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^Q\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_0^Q\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_S.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_0^Q\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_S.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_{m+1}^Q\\coloneqq F_m^Q\\cup\\{\\neg\\alpha:\\alpha\\in F_m^Q\\}\\cup\\{(\\alpha\\circ\\eta):\\alpha,\\eta\\in F_m^Q\\land\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\}\\cup\\{Qx\\alpha:Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists,Q_{\\aleph_1}\\}\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\land\\alpha\\in F_m^Q\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_{m+1}^Q\\coloneqq F_m^Q\\cup\\{\\neg\\alpha:\\alpha\\in F_m^Q\\}\\cup\\{(\\alpha\\circ\\eta):\\alpha,\\eta\\in F_m^Q\\land\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\}\\cup\\{Qx\\alpha:Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists,Q_{\\aleph_1}\\}\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\land\\alpha\\in F_m^Q\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^Q\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}F_m^Q.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Fml}_S^Q\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}F_m^Q.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\alpha)\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\neg\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\alpha),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\alpha\\circ\\eta)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\alpha)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\eta),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}_Q(Qx\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\alpha)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\alpha)\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\neg\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\alpha),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\alpha\\circ\\eta)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\alpha)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\eta),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}_Q(Qx\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\alpha)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S^Q\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^Q:\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\alpha)=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sent}_S^Q\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^Q:\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\alpha)=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\alpha\\leftrightarrow(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models\\alpha\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\alpha\\leftrightarrow(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models\\alpha\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\neg\\alpha&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\neg((\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\alpha),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q(\\alpha\\land\\eta)&amp;\\leftrightarrow((\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\alpha\\land(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\eta),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q(\\alpha\\lor\\eta)&amp;\\leftrightarrow((\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\alpha\\lor(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\eta),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q(\\alpha\\to\\eta)&amp;\\leftrightarrow((\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\alpha\\to(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\eta),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q(\\alpha\\leftrightarrow\\eta)&amp;\\leftrightarrow((\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\alpha\\leftrightarrow(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\eta),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\forall x\\alpha&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall a\\in A\\;((\\mathfrak A,\\beta[a/x])\\models_Q\\alpha),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\exists x\\alpha&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists a\\in A\\;((\\mathfrak A,\\beta[a/x])\\models_Q\\alpha),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q Q_{\\aleph_1}x\\alpha&amp;\\leftrightarrow|\\{a\\in A:(\\mathfrak A,\\beta[a/x])\\models_Q\\alpha\\}|\\ge\\aleph_1.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\neg\\alpha&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\neg((\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\alpha),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q(\\alpha\\land\\eta)&amp;\\leftrightarrow((\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\alpha\\land(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\eta),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q(\\alpha\\lor\\eta)&amp;\\leftrightarrow((\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\alpha\\lor(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\eta),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q(\\alpha\\to\\eta)&amp;\\leftrightarrow((\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\alpha\\to(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\eta),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q(\\alpha\\leftrightarrow\\eta)&amp;\\leftrightarrow((\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\alpha\\leftrightarrow(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\eta),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\forall x\\alpha&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall a\\in A\\;((\\mathfrak A,\\beta[a/x])\\models_Q\\alpha),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\exists x\\alpha&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists a\\in A\\;((\\mathfrak A,\\beta[a/x])\\models_Q\\alpha),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q Q_{\\aleph_1}x\\alpha&amp;\\leftrightarrow|\\{a\\in A:(\\mathfrak A,\\beta[a/x])\\models_Q\\alpha\\}|\\ge\\aleph_1.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models_Q\\alpha\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;((\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\alpha).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models_Q\\alpha\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;((\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models_Q\\alpha).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sen}_{\\mathcal L}(S)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_S^Q,\\qquad V_{\\mathcal L,S}(\\mathfrak A,\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\mathfrak A\\models_Q\\sigma,\\\\0,&amp;\\neg(\\mathfrak A\\models_Q\\sigma),\\end{cases}\\quad(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S^Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sen}_{\\mathcal L}(S)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_S^Q,\\qquad V_{\\mathcal L,S}(\\mathfrak A,\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\mathfrak A\\models_Q\\sigma,\\\\0,&amp;\\neg(\\mathfrak A\\models_Q\\sigma),\\end{cases}\\quad(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S^Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FO}(Q_{\\aleph_1})\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{Sen}_{\\mathcal L},V_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FO}(Q_{\\aleph_1})\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{Sen}_{\\mathcal L},V_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models Q_{\\aleph_1}x\\varphi\\leftrightarrow|\\{a\\in A:\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\langle a\\rangle/\\langle x\\rangle]\\}|\\ge\\aleph_1\\quad(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models Q_{\\aleph_1}x\\varphi\\leftrightarrow|\\{a\\in A:\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\langle a\\rangle/\\langle x\\rangle]\\}|\\ge\\aleph_1\\quad(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"d5f7158a321b8947","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-modified-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"549899f7f232c7be","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-modified-assignment]]","embed":false},